    "title": "Supply Chain Manager - Speed Post India Advisory Limited - Growth Opportunity",
    "description": "Grow your career with Speed Post India Advisory Limited! We are hiring a Supply Chain Manager for our Aurangabad team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Speed Post India Advisory Limited:\nSpeed Post India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Coordinate with warehousing teams for inbound and outbound operations\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Vendor Management\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Aurangabad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Speed Post India Advisory Limited!",
